  bx('ca', '<span class="tag">In the news · Jul 2026 (verify dates)</span><b>AHDC vs Sixth Schedule ADC:</b> AHDCs are statutory (LAHDC Act 1995; Leh 1995, Kargil 2003, 30 members each), cannot make laws; Sixth Schedule ADCs under Art 244(2) can, and have village courts.'),
  sec('PESA ACT, 1996 ' + P('2013'), 'b'),
