  bx('pk', '<b>Acquisition modes:</b> cession by treaty (purchase, gift, plebiscite), occupation of land under no sovereign. Handout omits lease and conquest (international law includes them). Integrated since 1950: <b>Dadra and Nagar Haveli, Goa, Daman and Diu, Puducherry, Sikkim</b>. <b>Part XXI</b> special provisions: Maharashtra, Gujarat, Nagaland, Assam, Manipur, Andhra Pradesh, Telangana, Sikkim, Mizoram, Arunachal Pradesh, Goa, Karnataka. Fifth and Sixth Schedules: separate regimes.'),
